>  Greetings.....
>   Anyone out there familiar with installing this game to a SUN platform ? 
>
>  I have followed to Instructions, edited the makefiles, config.h, unixconf.h, system.h,
>  ran make, make all, and make install. All directories seem to be created, but when I
>  enter ($GAMEDIR) & type nethack, the screen flashes and returns me to prompt.
>
>  I did have to delete the chmod, chgrp setups in the main makefile .
>
>  -Tom
>
The game won't work without chmod, chgrp, unless you log in as games (or
whatever is the owner of the game).  If your super-user won't run chmod,
chgrp for you, edit the makefiles and configs specifying your username as
owner.

